        <p>Dr. J. N. Patterson—proposed and seconded by Walter Middlewich and Wm. McCawley.</p>
        <p>NEWTON WARD.</p>
        <p>T. Ritchie—proposed and seconded by Robert Stone and Walter Stone.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1908-03-28_WidnesExaminer_art0077" n="art0077">
